{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LSD: Retro Dream Emulator is a surrealist first-person adventure/walking simulator game about dreams, featuring</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* trippy, psychedelic visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* challenging platforms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* experimental cosmic horror elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* and last but not least, an overarching feeling of NEVER knowing what to expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It explores the idea of a mind losing its grasp with reality, as reality turns into a dream, and that dream turns into a nightmare. It has an off-kilter tone that can shift from overly chill to downright scary. Often it resembles an acid trip, or an interactive fever dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Retro game influenced by the original <strong>LSD: Dream Emulator</strong> from PSX and cosmic horror. Immerse yourself in a dreamy and psychedelic  world through low poly environments and liminal spaces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game contains gameplay with lots of dreamy scenarios, even more freaky visuals, deconstructed urban landscapes and/or dreamscapes, existential angst, and a bit of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore your deepest thoughts in this game that challenges your mind, between dreams and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the art of artists like Moebius, H.P. Lovecraft, Alejandro Jodorowsky, H.R. Giger, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A TOTAL experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Still looking for it?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3299190/7c174c6349329c400bad28a7e01f7ccca6b91e50.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299190?t=1742717996","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299190?t=1742717996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s